01:13.916 --> 01:17.353
That's Girl Q

01:17.353 --> 01:18.946
Girl Q

01:21.490 --> 01:25.628
To the mysterious girl, everyone is like

01:25.628 --> 01:28.130
(Love ya, love ya, ya ya ya ya ya)

01:28.130 --> 01:32.234
With stimulating gaze

01:32.234 --> 01:34.737
(Love ya, love ya, ya ya ya ya ya)

01:34.737 --> 01:38.040
Someone please make me cry

01:38.040 --> 01:39.208
Someone please make me cry

01:41.343 --> 01:44.680
Someone please make me cry

01:44.680 --> 01:45.848
Someone please make me cry

02:01.530 --> 02:02.231
It's lunchtime!

02:02.231 --> 02:03.465
It's lunchtime!

02:03.465 --> 02:06.230
The clock is now turned back to a little earlier!

02:09.505 --> 02:11.098
Go to hell, Film Club!

02:12.007 --> 02:13.975
