02:31.193 --> 02:32.962
Oh, there she is.

02:32.962 --> 02:34.997
Target spotted!

02:34.997 --> 02:36.398
Huh? What's going on?

02:36.398 --> 02:37.933
Get her! Get her!

02:37.933 --> 02:40.469
Hey, Suzune, go easy on her!

02:40.469 --> 02:41.959
Yeah, I know.

02:42.271 --> 02:43.238
CHOP!

02:49.345 --> 02:50.813
Pi... ko...

02:52.448 --> 02:55.050
Hey, didn't I tell you to go easy on her?!

02:55.050 --> 02:57.920
What? I did!

02:57.920 --> 02:59.121
Look at her!

02:59.121 --> 03:00.689
Well then, everyone!

03:00.689 --> 03:02.088
Withdraw!

03:02.491 --> 03:04.118
Thank you for having us!

03:04.960 --> 03:07.196
They took my enemy away!

03:20.009 --> 03:22.068
Wh-Wh-What's going on?!

03:24.380 --> 03:27.182
So you're awake, Akane Serizawa.

03:27.182 --> 03:28.274
Mahoyoooon!

03:28.584 --> 03:30.780
