03:31.053 --> 03:33.750
Hello, I'm Rebecca Ichijo.

03:34.290 --> 03:35.691
You don't sound like her AT ALL.

03:35.691 --> 03:36.783
I know...

03:37.259 --> 03:39.795
Well, that's the whole point.

03:39.795 --> 03:40.496
Huh?

03:40.496 --> 03:44.300
Well, it's a long story, so I'll just summarize it.

03:44.300 --> 03:47.201
Basically, none of us could pull off Becky.

03:47.436 --> 03:49.939
You summarized it too much. I don't get it at all.

03:49.939 --> 03:53.500
Then the bunny will explain it for you.

03:53.776 --> 03:57.313
What? M-Me? Uh, well...

03:57.313 --> 03:58.337
Just kidding.

03:58.447 --> 04:00.415
Oh... Huh?

04:00.716 --> 04:03.310
I'm relieved, but at the same time
I feel kinda sad...

04:03.652 --> 04:05.154
I guess we have no choice.

04:05.154 --> 04:07.823
It's a pain in the butt, but
I'd better explain everything to you...

04:07.823 --> 04:09.313
Don't say it's a pain in the butt!

04:11.760 --> 04:13.362
Not that this is anything new,

04:13.362 --> 04:16.525
but the PTA members have been
complaining about Becky.

04:16.999 --> 04:20.169
They've been saying maybe it's just too much
for a little kid to teach, period.

04:20.703 --> 04:24.173
So they decided to inspect actual classes
she teaches. Well, it's more like...

04:24.707 --> 04:27.176
They're going to nit-pick!

04:27.710 --> 04:30.907
But... But Becky has gone missing!

04:31.213 --> 04:32.047
Missing?

04:32.047 --> 04:32.948
That's correct.

04:32.948 --> 04:35.617
Supposedly she left home this morning as usual,

04:35.617 --> 04:37.949
but she still hasn't shown up at school yet.

04:38.120 --> 04:40.384
We haven't been able to reach
her cell phone, either.

04:40.689 --> 04:41.957
At this rate, Becky will be maximum-scolded!

04:41.957 --> 04:44.326
At this rate, Becky will be maximum-scolded!

04:44.326 --> 04:48.695
Or they'll consider it abandoning a class
and fire her for sure.

04:48.964 --> 04:50.132
Ma!

04:50.132 --> 04:51.622
I don't want that to happen!

04:51.934 --> 04:56.269
So we figured one of us should dress up
as Becky to trick them, but...

04:56.505 --> 04:58.530
None of us look quite convincing...

05:00.075 --> 05:02.845
I see, so that's what this is all about.

05:02.845 --> 05:05.114
All right, I get it.

05:05.114 --> 05:07.515
But why is THIS happening to ME?

05:07.750 --> 05:09.051
Kashiwagi Twins!

05:09.051 --> 05:10.143
Yes!

05:10.319 --> 05:12.185
FYI, I'm Yuma!

05:12.388 --> 05:14.156
That doesn't really matter.

05:14.156 --> 05:15.190
Yes, it does!

05:15.190 --> 05:16.521
Here you go.

05:17.760 --> 05:18.852
What's this?

05:18.994 --> 05:20.863
Oh, not bad at all.

05:20.863 --> 05:23.232
Yeah, you can't say she doesn't look like her.

05:23.232 --> 05:25.701
This is not necessarily "of the year," but...

05:25.701 --> 05:28.295
Yeah, I think it'll work.

05:28.937 --> 05:31.565
D-don't tell me you're thinking...

05:31.707 --> 05:32.508
Heh.

05:32.508 --> 05:35.044
N-No way! I'm NOT going to do this!

05:35.044 --> 05:37.604
I absolutely do NOT want to play her double!

05:38.680 --> 05:41.583
This is the "Victorious Operation V Manual”!

05:41.583 --> 05:44.386
If you follow this manual,
you'll be able to teach the class just fine!

05:44.386 --> 05:45.087
Listen to me, damn it!

05:45.087 --> 05:45.654
Listen to me, damn it!

05:48.057 --> 05:49.024
LISTEN TO ME!

05:49.024 --> 05:51.660
<i>I'm not “Twins"! I'm Yumal</i>

05:51.660 --> 05:53.929
Like I said, that doesn't really matter.

05:53.929 --> 05:55.097
Yes it does!

05:55.097 --> 05:56.292
